- Priority: P1
- Status: COMPLETED
- Rationale: Modern open weights commonly use Qwen 2.5 architecture (QKV bias vectors, custom RoPE frequency scaling, different head count ratios).
- Files: `src/model.rs`, `src/tokenizer/mod.rs`, `tests/model.rs`
