156-- Rationale: Very long prompt ingestion (e.g. 16k-64k tokens) monopolizes execution threads and causes high time-to-first-token (TTFT) tail latencies. Chunked prefill partitions large prompts into bounded token chunks (e.g. 512 tokens), interleaving prompt chunk ingestion with active sequence decode steps to maintain bounded response latency.
157-- Files: `src/model.rs`, `src/lib.rs`, `src/main.rs`, `tests/model.rs`
