178-- Priority: P2
179:- Status: COMPLETED
180-- Rationale: Repeated system prompts, multi-turn dialogues, and agentic workflows share identical token prefixes. Radix-tree prefix cache indexes previously evaluated blocks by token hashes for instantaneous 0ms ingestion of cached prefixes.
