+-//! Zero-dependency in-engine model quantization tool (`ferrite quantize`).
+-//!
+-//! Converts full-precision (F32/F16/BF16) GGUF models directly into high-performance
+-//! quantized formats (`Q8_0`, `Q4_0`) without requiring llama.cpp or external C/C++ tools.
